{"5362020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Left! Left! LEFT!","steam_appid":5362020,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left! Left! LEFT!<\/strong> is a 2-player asymmetrical co-op rally chaos game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One drives a highly unstable hatchback with almost no HUD and zero map. The other sits  with a physical tablet — GTA-style road minimap, cabin physics, and a voice that has to cut through panic.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no AI enemies. The track is narrow. The car is sloppy. The cabin fights back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5362020\/extras\/0fe0eb72e5064f9327e5ed538212fda4.poster.avif?t=1791998103\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5362020\/extras\/0fe0eb72e5064f9327e5ed538212fda4.webm?t=1791998103\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5362020\/extras\/0fe0eb72e5064f9327e5ed538212fda4.mp4?t=1791998103\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive blind. Navigate loud. Survive the cabin.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetrical co-op — Driver vs. the road; Navigator vs. the cabin<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical tablet navigation — grab it, hold it, drop it, lose it mid-corner<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cabin chaos — mud on the glass, dash knob wipe, doors that won't stay shut<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade wreck physics — readable, messy hatchback feel (not a sim)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for online du